{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50907","headline":"重台芙蓉 · 裴说","name":"重台芙蓉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆芳凋落後，特地遇阳和。\n一一开虽晚，重重得亦多。\n畧无幽鸟语，时有冻蜂过。\n日暮寒阶畔，轻红拂浅莎。\n（见《永乐大典》卷五四○「一东」「蓉」字「重台芙蓉」条〖一函三册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}